  "bodyHash": "f20e026c9d417b48",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/h5PZk4XS090?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">來自<a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/maps/2808484-mario-kart-in-minecraft-by-flamingosaurus-and\" rel=\"nofollow\">《我的世界》瑪利歐賽車</a>的創作者們帶來了另一款競技賽車地圖！這個版本不含受版權保護的內容，並已正式收錄於Java版《我的世界》Realms服務器中。然而，Sprint Racer並非簡單的複製貼上——它經過了重寫、重新平衡，並打磨至鏡面般的光潔度！</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">功能特色</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">支援任意數量玩家（1至無限）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">競賽模式與戰鬥模式</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">50條賽道，18個戰鬥競技場</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">20種獨特道具</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">自訂賽道編輯器 <em>（*非Realms專屬功能）</em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">智能AI對手</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">知識共享許可證背景音樂（由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsoundcloud.com%252fzetasphere\" rel=\"nofollow\">ZetaSphere</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsoundcloud.com%252fargofox\" rel=\"nofollow\">Argofox</a> 唱片公司提供）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">豐富的功能選項和額外特性</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">隱藏作弊碼</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">公共服務器的「管理員模式」</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/resource_media/screenshot/15067603_lrg.png\" alt=\"遊戲大廳\" width=\"1280\" height=\"667\"></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">支援語言</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">英文</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">法文 (fr_fr, fr_ca)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">日文 (ja_jp)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">簡體中文 (zh_cn)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">繁體中文 (zh_tw)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">韓文 (ko)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"> LOLCAT (lol_us)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">相容性</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#5f5;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">相容於：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Minecraft: Java Edition 1.16 - 1.21（請確保您擁有正確的地圖版本！）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">BungeeCord</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Fabric（不保證遊戲穩定性，建議使用原版遊玩）</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">不相容於：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Multiverse</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">過多的伺服器插件（可能會出現問題）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">除Java版以外的《我的世界》發行版</span></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">自《我的世界》瑪利歐賽車以來有哪些變更？</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">性能和穩定性大幅改善。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">單人遊戲體驗因加入AI而顯著提升。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">新增了許多專屬賽道！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">道具及道具系統經過重新設計，極大地改善了遊戲玩法。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">大廳界面更加簡潔，但仍提供比以往更多的自定義選項。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">新增了多種遊戲模式，例如「最後一名淘汰制」。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">賽道編輯器變得更加用戶友好。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Sprint Racer 也可在 StickyPiston 試玩：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftrial.stickypiston.co%252fmap%252fsprintracer\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#000\"><img src=\"https://stickypiston.co/wp-content/uploads/sprintracer_banner.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"755\" height=\"144\"></span></a></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">致謝</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>遊戲設計</strong> -- Flamingosaurus, AriaZeroQueen<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>程式開發</strong> -- Flamingosaurus</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>遊戲大廳</strong> -- MCFilms, Jayjo</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>賽道設計</strong> -- AriaZeroQueen, Flamingosaurus, ReflectedMantis, RedstoneBattery, alyssonjac6, MichaelMana, Marioman237, Darkbrine, Endermity, MCFilms, Jayjo, StraightFlex, Mezimo, Cqvid_69, SenpaiiPepe</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>自訂模型</strong> -- Frenderman, Flamingosaurus</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>雜項建築協助</strong> -- RedstoneBattery, alyssonjac6, Darkbrine</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.flamingosaurus.com%252fgames%252fsprint-racer%252fresources\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>額外軟體與外掛</strong></a> -- tari_cat</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>測試/反饋</strong> -- RedstoneBattery, ashjade210, CosmicMary, ReflectedMantis, Darkbrine, MCFilms, Szpecter, KittyCatElite, Bed_Gsd, MarioSpore</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>宣傳素材</strong> -- FortressFrog, Mezimo, Frenderman, JohnGlacious</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">想要更多賽道？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">試試 ReflectedMantis 的<strong><em>瑪利歐賽車賽道包！</em>&nbsp;</strong>這是 Sprint Racer 的最新版本，額外增加了20條自訂賽道。</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.flamingosaurus.com%252fgames%252fsprint-racer%252fcustom-tracks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#5f5\">您可以在這裡找到該賽道包（以及其他自訂賽道）的連結。</span></a></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/b5s8VlB8Kaw\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>",
